  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e20dc807e2b143e4caa16853e4597593, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OperatorNoteBoard
  labelEn: Cork board
  labelPt: "Quadro de corti\xE7a"
  titleEn: WHAT I KNOW
  titlePt: O QUE EU SEI
  bodyEn: '- Her name is Helena. She doesn''t remember how she got into the cell.

    -
    I don''t remember how I got into this room.

    - Somebody locked the door at
    00:01. Not me.

    - Save rooms are safe. Everywhere else is not.

    - The
    previous operator was "06". Where is 06?

    - She trusts my voice. Why?'
  bodyPt: "- O nome dela \xE9 Helena. Ela n\xE3o lembra como foi parar na cela.\n-
    Eu n\xE3o lembro como vim parar nesta sala.\n- Algu\xE9m trancou a porta \xE0s
    00:01. N\xE3o fui eu.\n- As salas de salvar s\xE3o seguras. O resto n\xE3o.\n-
    O operador anterior era o \"06\". Cad\xEA o 06?\n- Ela confia na minha voz. Por
    qu\xEA?"
